---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="About Oneira Home: Dream Dictionary & Meanings"
  description="Learn about Oneira Home: Dream Dictionary, a free resource for understanding dream meanings and interpretations."
>
  <h1>About Oneira Home</h1>

  <p>
    Oneira Home Dream Dictionary is a free, growing reference for understanding the symbols,
    people, and scenarios that show up in dreams. Our goal is simple: give you a
    clear, thoughtful starting point for thinking through what your dream might
    mean, without the fluff or fear-mongering that a lot of "dream meaning"
    content online leans on.
  </p>

  <h2>What we do</h2>
  <p>
    Each entry in the dictionary looks at a dream symbol from a few angles - its
    general meaning, common variations of how it tends to appear, a psychological
    perspective, and a short prompt to help you reflect on what it might connect
    to in your own life. We update and add new entries regularly.
  </p>

  <h2>How our content is written</h2>
  <p>
    We use a combination of AI-assisted writing and human review to produce and
    edit our content efficiently. Every article goes through an editing pass
    before publishing, and we run quality checks for length, structure, and
    repetition. That said, this site is intended for reflection and general
    interest - it is not a substitute for professional psychological, medical,
    or mental health advice. See our <a href="/terms/">Terms & Conditions</a>
    for more on how to use this content responsibly.
  </p>

  <h2>Get in touch</h2>
  <p>
    Have a suggestion for a dream symbol we haven't covered yet, found an error,
    or just want to say hello? Reach out at
    <a href="mailto:hello@oneirahome.com">hello@oneirahome.com</a>.
  </p>
</BaseLayout>
